  },
  {
   "text": "I've never used ChatGPT. If I'm absolutely honest, although I've heard of Claude, I'm not 100% sure what it is. I've never knowingly used an #AI tool.\nTo me, this post reads like 'If pre-sliced cheese was suddenly banned, would you even know how to slice cheese manually?'",
